{
  "_implementation_notes": [
    "FUCHSIA CITY FILL — Phase 2 (Post-Saffron reflection).",
    "Covers: Pokemon Center (476), Safari Zone Gate inner (804),",
    "Fuchsia houses (481, 482), Fuchsia Hotel (477, 478),",
    "Safari Zone areas (484-488, 717, 107), Routes 14-15 (440, 444),",
    "Fishing Hut (471), Gate (213), Creepy House (712-714),",
    "Underwater (162).",
    "",
    "Tone: Direct heat. Quiet after the storm. Strength is currency.",
    "NPCs know people who've died. Koga's practical ethos pervades.",
    "Safari Zone: ecological preserve. Unfused species struggle.",
    "",
    "PRESERVED (mechanical/quest): Nurse healing (476 E4),",
    "Iron Head tutor (476 E17), Musharna/HA tracker (481 E5),",
    "Janine trade (482 E5 — mechanical flow preserved, light flavor),",
    "Hotel rest/salon (477 E5/15/16), Bike Race (478 E10/11),",
    "Grimer quest (478 E6), Chansey quest (478 E7/8),",
    "Carvanha quest (478 E12), Safari Zone entry (804 E3/7),",
    "Signal Beam tutor (484 E16), Safari signs (484 E8-11),",
    "meteor (485 E19), CutTree (485 E37), Scolipede (485 E33/38),",
    "white rocks (486), Diglett (487), wild Pokemon (488),",
    "Chansey owner (717 E3), Secret House HM (107 E1),",
    "all trainer battles (440, 444), Pokemon nests (444 E8/25),",
    "Fishing Guru brother (471 E3), Oak assistant (213 E5),",
    "wildlife boards (213 E1/2), Underwater (162),",
    "Creepy House books/beds/dolls/mirrors (712-714 — ALL preserved).",
    "",
    "Line length limit: ~42 characters per line."
  ],
  "maps": {
    "476": {
      "name": "Pokemon Center (Fuchsia)",
      "events": {
        "9": {
          "name": "EV009 — Paras NPC",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Paras is one of the few",
                    "species still thriving in",
                    "the Safari Zone. Tough",
                    "little things."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Their effect spores keep",
                    "giving me allergies, but",
                    "at least they're surviving.",
                    "More than I can say for",
                    "Chansey out there."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "11": {
          "name": "EV011 — Pokemon Lover",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Pokemon are everywhere in",
                    "Fuchsia — the Zoo, the",
                    "Safari Zone. It's one of",
                    "the last places where you",
                    "can see unfused species",
                    "living naturally."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Koga fights to keep it",
                    "that way. Not for politics.",
                    "Just because he thinks",
                    "strength means surviving",
                    "on your own terms."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "15": {
          "name": "Gary — Rival Resting",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": { "switch1_id": 165 },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Getting some rest before",
                    "I head out again."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Heard there's trouble in",
                    "Saffron. Rocket took over",
                    "the whole city. The League",
                    "can't — or won't — act."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "477": {
      "name": "Fuchsia Hotel (Lobby)",
      "events": {
        "11": {
          "name": "EV011 — Time Tip NPC",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Moonlight and Morning Sun",
                    "let you wait for night or",
                    "dawn when you're outdoors."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Useful when there's no",
                    "hotel nearby. Out on these",
                    "routes, you learn to be",
                    "self-sufficient."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "12": {
          "name": "EV012 — Koga Rumor NPC",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I heard Koga turned down",
                    "the Elite Four. Said",
                    "Fuchsia needed him more."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Between you and me, I",
                    "think he just doesn't want",
                    "to answer to anyone. The",
                    "man does things his way."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "478": {
      "name": "Fuchsia Hotel (Quests)",
      "events": {
        "9": {
          "name": "EV009 — Empty Room",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 0,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The room is empty. A pair",
                    "of muddy boots by the door.",
                    "Someone who walks the",
                    "routes, not the city."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "482": {
      "name": "Fuchsia City (Janine House)",
      "events": {
        "5": {
          "name": "EV005 — Janine",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": { "self_switch": "A" },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Hello! I'm Janine, the",
                    "daughter of Fuchsia City's",
                    "Gym Leader."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 6,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "We've met before, yes?",
                    "My father says a trainer",
                    "who can't adapt isn't a",
                    "trainer at all. That goes",
                    "for me too."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": { "switch1_id": 413, "self_switch": "A" },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Someday I want to be a",
                    "Gym Leader like my father.",
                    "That's why I train so hard."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "He says the world doesn't",
                    "care about your reasons.",
                    "Only your results."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "484": {
      "name": "Safari Zone — Area 2",
      "events": {
        "16": {
          "name": "EV016 — Safari Visitor/Tutor",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The Safari Zone is one of",
                    "the last places where you",
                    "can find unfused species.",
                    "Outside these fences,",
                    "they can't compete."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "717": {
      "name": "Safari Zone — Area 5 (Rest House)",
      "events": {
        "5": {
          "name": "Artifact Finder",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Found a rare artifact in",
                    "the sand outside! The",
                    "Safari Zone is full of",
                    "surprises. Natural ones.",
                    "No fusion required."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "7": {
          "name": "Desert Temple NPC",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "There's a rare Pokemon",
                    "deep in the desert temple.",
                    "A real maze in there."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But the Pokemon that live",
                    "there are pure. Unfused.",
                    "Worth the challenge."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "440": {
      "name": "Route 14",
      "events": {
        "1": {
          "name": "Trainer(3) — Bird Keeper",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "My Pidgeot won't fuse.",
                    "I've had offers. Good ones.",
                    "But she's been with me",
                    "since I was ten."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "9": {
          "name": "Trainer(5) — Legendary Question",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Have you heard about the",
                    "legendary Pokemon? They",
                    "say some are so powerful",
                    "no ball can catch them.",
                    "Almost no ball."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "444": {
      "name": "Route 15",
      "events": {
        "10": {
          "name": "Trainer(5) — Lonely Raiser",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I raise Pokemon because I",
                    "live alone out here. They",
                    "keep me company. I don't",
                    "need fusion for that."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "27": {
          "name": "EV027 — Creepy House Warning",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I followed a wild Pokemon",
                    "near that old house and I",
                    "swear I saw something move",
                    "inside the windows."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I wouldn't go in there.",
                    "Some places remember bad",
                    "things."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "213": {
      "name": "Route 15/18 Gate",
      "events": {
        "4": {
          "name": "EV004 — Ghost House NPC",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "There's an old house in",
                    "the swamp. My sister says",
                    "she saw a ghost there."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Probably just a wild",
                    "Pokemon. But out here,",
                    "you learn not to dismiss",
                    "anything."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "471": {
      "name": "Fishing Hut",
      "events": {
        "1": {
          "name": "EV001 — Fish Smell 1",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 0,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Smells like fish. And",
                    "something else. The water",
                    "Pokemon are changing —",
                    "fused things washing up",
                    "that nobody can name."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "2": {
          "name": "EV002 — Fish Smell 2",
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {},
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 0,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Smells like fish. The old",
                    "man's been here for years.",
                    "Says the catch has changed.",
                    "Less Magikarp. More things",
                    "he doesn't recognize."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
